
@contentType = application/json

### Logga in som tekniker — KÖR DENNA FÖRST
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userName": "{{techUserName}}",
  "password": "{{techPassword}}"
}

### Hämta MIN aktiva varukorg
GET {{host}}/api/carts/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Hämta MIN historik
GET {{host}}/api/carts/me/history
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Skapa ny varukorg → 201
# @name createCart
POST {{host}}/api/carts
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "assignmentId": null,
  "jobId": null
}

### Lägg till produkt i aktiv varukorg
POST {{host}}/api/carts/items
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 3
}

### Uppdatera antal (byt :1 mot riktigt cartItemId)
PATCH {{host}}/api/carts/items/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "quantity": 7
}

### Ta bort en rad
DELETE {{host}}/api/carts/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Slutför egen varukorg
POST {{host}}/api/carts/{{createCart.response.body.$.id}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Negativtest — Quantity 0 → 400
POST {{host}}/api/carts/items
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 0
}

### Negativtest — utan token → 401
GET {{host}}/api/carts/me

### Negativtest — försök lista alla carts (kräver Admin) → 403
GET {{host}}/api/carts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Radera egen cart
DELETE {{host}}/api/carts/{{createCart.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
